  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Charlotte found a photograph slipped under her door.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It showed a mansion she'd never visited.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.18
    },
    {
      "text": "In the upstairs window stood a girl.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.18
    },
    {
      "text": "The girl looked exactly like Charlotte.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.27
    },
    {
      "text": "Her friend Ruby laughed.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.15
    },
    {
      "text": "“It's just a prank, Charlotte.”",
      "tag": "[laughs]",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "speak": "It's just a prank, Charlotte.",
      "voice": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next morning, the girl stood closer.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "On the third day, the window was open.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.18
    },
    {
      "text": "And the girl was gone.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.27
    },
    {
      "text": "That evening, an invitation arrived.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.15
    },
    {
      "text": "The address matched the mansion.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.27
    },
    {
      "text": "A butler opened the door without a word.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Guests were waiting inside.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "“We've been expecting you.”",
      "tag": "[warmly]",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "speak": "We've been expecting you.",
      "voice": "hostess"
    },
    {
      "text": "When she turned, the ballroom was empty.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Twelve untouched plates waited on the table.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Photographs of every guest lined the staircase.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Every face had been scratched out.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.15
    },
    {
      "text": "Even Ruby's.",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "At the top hung one final photograph.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.18
    },
    {
      "text": "It showed Charlotte in the ballroom, surrounded by twelve people.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "Then chairs scraped across the floor, one by one.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.25
    },
    {
      "text": "A voice whispered behind her,",
      "tag": "[softly]",
      "pause": 0.15
    },
    {
      "text": "“You're the last one we needed.”",
      "tag": "[whispers]",
      "pause": 0.4,
      "speak": "You're the last one we needed.",
      "voice": "guests",
      "fx": "whisper"
    },
    {
      "text": "She looked at the photograph again.",
      "tag": "[calm]",
      "pause": 0.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Now thirteen people stood in it.",
      "tag": "[mysterious]",
      "pause": 0.2
    },
    {
      "text": "And none of them had faces.",
      "tag": "[whispers]",
      "pause": 0.15
    }
  ],
